      "script": "BUS 166 (warm, clear, starts when the bus leaves the Interchange Bus stop)\n\nWelcome, Passenger of Time.\nI am Bus 166.\nYou have joined me in motion.\nFor as long as you decide,\nI will carry you across the island—\nalong housing estates and reservoirs,\nunder tunnels and over old rivers,\ntowards a forest that may soon vanish…\nor survive.\nLook out through my windows, [pause]\nconstruction zones pass by—\nthe North–South Corridor in the making.\nThe city rehearses its next version.\nPeople wait at the next stop.\nThe future arrives in stages.\nStay on board,\nor step off to wander a trail.\nEither way,\nthis journey belongs to you.\nLet the outside world fade.\nLet the bus become your moving theatre.\nEverything you see is temporary.\nIncluding me.",
      "notes": [
        "Spoken text follows the recording; unspoken stage directions and explanatory translations are omitted."
      ],
