      "script": "Bus 166\nAlright—we are rolling!\nMayflower Stop Ahead\nA good name, if you like trees.\nFewer flowers than promised, though.\n\nRECLAIMED ARCHIVE\nMayflower, the name of a ship that crossed the ocean.\nPeople, beliefs, fears, ambitions—\na floating beginning.\nHistory remembers the landing,\nnot the uncertainty of the voyage.",
